{
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 240,
      "end_ms": 320,
      "text": "But"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 560,
      "end_ms": 2240,
      "text": "I stayed that spring and built me a boat,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 3230,
      "end_ms": 3310,
      "text": "The"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 3550,
      "end_ms": 5150,
      "text": "greeting of the Apostle is refreshing,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 6318,
      "end_ms": 6398,
      "text": "I"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 6478,
      "end_ms": 8078,
      "text": "painted the eyes red for anger,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 9230,
      "end_ms": 11230,
      "text": "Not all the Galatians had become perverted,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 12206,
      "end_ms": 14606,
      "text": "May you drink heart's ease from it for many years,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 15726,
      "end_ms": 17086,
      "text": "Experience proves this."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 17998,
      "end_ms": 18078,
      "text": "Now"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 18398,
      "end_ms": 20478,
      "text": "she put her hand on his arm and smiled and said"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 21934,
      "end_ms": 22014,
      "text": "The"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 22254,
      "end_ms": 24254,
      "text": "world brands this a pernicious doctrine."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 25422,
      "end_ms": 28222,
      "text": "Thirty men, one after another, raised their horns and said"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 29550,
      "end_ms": 29630,
      "text": "It"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 29870,
      "end_ms": 31150,
      "text": "spoils one's best work."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 32910,
      "end_ms": 32990,
      "text": "It"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 33150,
      "end_ms": 35870,
      "text": "is manifest that man is now subject to much variability,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 36878,
      "end_ms": 36958,
      "text": "In"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 37198,
      "end_ms": 39998,
      "text": "every way they sought to undermine the authority of Saint Paul."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "start_ms": 41262,
      "end_ms": 44142,
      "text": "Effects of the increased use and disuse of parts."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "start_ms": 46382,
      "end_ms": 49542,
      "text": "Обязательно! Ты будешь в восторге! Как лечить?"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_5",
      "start_ms": 50446,
      "end_ms": 50486,
      "text": "О"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_5",
      "start_ms": 50726,
      "end_ms": 53086,
      "text": "нет, я уже догадываюсь, чем это закончилось."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "start_ms": 53686,
      "end_ms": 55046,
      "text": "Я сегодня просто в шоке."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "start_ms": 55654,
      "end_ms": 57174,
      "text": "Он так сильно изменился!"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "start_ms": 58230,
      "end_ms": 63030,
      "text": "Мы хорошо знаем друг друга. Согласна. Мир такой большой и интересный."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "start_ms": 64342,
      "end_ms": 66462,
      "text": "Ну, не очень удачно, надо больше практики."
    }
  ]
}
